fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1068413/d010e826-85a7-4230-b311-2ecc3f47ab7d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1068413/d010e826-85a7-4230-b311-2ecc3f47ab7d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"***Not suitable for long-term rent***\n\nEconomy Quadruple Room\n\nA modern basement apartment that is suitable as a shared apartment and is also used as such. The apartment has\n3 separate rooms,\neach with 2 single beds and a bunk bed.\nThe kitchen is separate with a stove, 2 large refrigerators.\nA washroom with 2 toilets and a urinal are available.\nEach room has a separate shower cubicle for private use. The 3 shower cubicles are equipped with modern massage showers (one on a tripod and the second mobile) and are located in a shared wet room that can be locked. There are also 2 sinks with a large mirror. A washing machine and a dryer are also there. More pictures on request.\nEach room is furnished with a table + wardrobe and 2 chairs. Linen is changed every week. towels are there (no bath towels).\nWiFi with a repeater to boost the internet signal is available on site.\n\nMinimum stay 2 nights! \nThe price for the rent for 1 month is 850 € also just for a one guest. every one more must pay extra 150 € for 1 Month\n\nQuiet after 10 p.m\nSMOKING is not permitted in the property. A smoking place in front of the entrance is specially set up and nicely equipped.\nHygiene in the kitchen and on the toilet after use is a matter of course.\nNo open food should be left on the table.\nWASTE SEPARATION is MANDATORY.\n\nParking is free on the street outside but private parking is also available at €5 per day.\nThe renatal price is just for 1 person!\nEach another person + 200€ ","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":